OL,3,GNEWSAPolice get more time to question
OL,4,Amurder suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the death of a
OL,7,Fwoman in Nottinghamshire have been
OL,8,Fgranted additional time to question a
OL,9,Fman arrested on suspicion of her
OL,10,Fmurder.
OL,12,FThe victim, 52, was discovered by
OL,13,Fofficers at an address in James Close,
OL,14,FOllerton, shortly before 20:00 BST on
OL,15,FSunday.
OL,17,FA 60-year-old man, who police say was
OL,18,Fknown to the victim, was later arrested
OL,19,Fon suspicion of murder and remains in
OL,20,Fcustody.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
