OL,3,GNEWSAPolice get more time to question
OL,4,Amurder suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers were granted an additional 36
OL,7,Fhours by the courts on Tuesday to
OL,8,Fdetain the suspect while further lines
OL,9,Fof inquiry were explored.
